1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,790
(Penny:)He spent the entire night...

2
00:00:01,961 --> 00:00:06,301
(Penny:)...bragging about how he invented
the word "appeteasers."

3
00:00:08,092 --> 00:00:09,422
[LEONARD CHUCKLING]

4
00:00:09,594 --> 00:00:11,134
(Leonard:)How is that my fault?

5
00:00:11,304 --> 00:00:14,094
(Penny:)You have destroyed my ability
to tolerate idiots.

6
00:00:14,265 --> 00:00:15,475
(Penny:)Now, come with me.

7
00:00:15,642 --> 00:00:17,892
(Leonard:)-Where are we going?
-We're gonna have sex.

8
00:00:18,061 --> 00:00:20,651
LEONARD:
Why? I mean, okay.

9
00:00:22,774 --> 00:00:23,814
(Penny:)What's going on?

10
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:27,820
Put on your noise-canceling headphones,
because it's gonna get loud.

11
00:00:30,198 --> 00:00:33,238
Ugh. Not this again.

12
00:00:46,422 --> 00:00:50,052
In what universe is this "low-pulp"?

13
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,350
(Sheldon:)Good morning, Penny.

14
00:00:54,806 --> 00:00:57,016
(Penny:)Do you have eyes
in the back of your head?

15
00:00:57,183 --> 00:00:59,643
(Sheldon:)When one gets beaten up
every other day in school...

16
00:00:59,811 --> 00:01:04,021
(Sheldon:)...one, of necessity,
develops a keen sense of hearing.

